[{"title":"访菊","author":"秦廷璧","text":"遥忆篱边思不禁，闲时走访且高吟。\n雪霜枝好搜罗遍，隐逸花宜物色深。\n或自支筇甘谷觅，有时载酒石崖寻。\n餐英嚼蕊秋来乐，相对真堪惬素心。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37814,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"折菊","author":"秦廷璧","text":"无心闲步到柴桑，忽见荒畦花正黄。\n映月摘来盈手冷，带霜插得满头香。\n疏篱采撷高人梦，芳径徘徊隐士狂。\n分付铜瓶好洗涤，归家供养佐飞觞。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37815,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"饯菊","author":"秦廷璧","text":"赏秋已少客来过，一霎秋光感逝波。\n佳色阑珊留蝶梦，落英狼藉唱骊歌。\n白衣人到离情绕，玉质枝残别恨多。\n帘卷西风花落尽，古松犹自耸岩阿。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37816,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"哭石甫叔","author":"秦廷璧","text":"玉楼赴召太匆匆，一线难延恨未穷。\n好月不圆成谶语，微云共话想清风。\n于今弥觉多情苦，此后愈知世事空。\n苦海无边欣解脱，劝君莫再忆寰中。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37817,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"哭晴庚岳父四首 其一","author":"秦廷璧","text":"天然骨骼本孤高，耿介心情怀节操。\n数载驱驰耽客况，毕生怀抱托离骚。\n功名竟为儒冠误，生计都从铁砚叨。\n剩有一编遗稿在，不随岁月去滔滔。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37818,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"哭晴庚岳父四首 其二","author":"秦廷璧","text":"身似人间一野鸥，胸怀冷淡品兼优。\n生涯早被饥寒逼，风味还于笔墨求。\n冰雪练成奇骨峻，年华逝去素心愁。\n凄凉千种都消歇，无意荣名实寡俦。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37819,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"哭晴庚岳父四首 其三","author":"秦廷璧","text":"遥想吟魂宛在形，霎时竟已赴幽冥。\n多才易惹天公忌，绝俗当为后辈型。\n彩笔真堪追李白，扁舟独自载樵青。\n河干分手成长别，梦里何曾一降灵。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37820,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"哭晴庚岳父四首 其四","author":"秦廷璧","text":"东南世界遍烽烟，怅望归舟竟不旋。\n困守青毡君薄命，叨陪函丈我无缘。\n工愁身比寒梅瘦，多病踪随独鹤眠。\n如此才华埋地底，教人焉得不凄然。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37821,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"水居怀古","author":"项继皋","text":"昔日曾游旧水居，而今境象变邱墟。\n四围楼阁曾何在，一色蒹葭总自如。\n泛宅同怀仙蠡迹，遗篇已作祖龙书。\n年来耕畔寻诗友，容我从头问老渔。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37822,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"偶成","author":"秦涌","text":"万里萧条景，江澜客夜愁。\n家山无限思，把酒倚高楼。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37823,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"君山","author":"秦涌","text":"晚磬黄泥庵，瘦石春申墓。\n烟外马驮沙，浮屠隐没树。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37824,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"渔舟吹笛","author":"秦涌","text":"江渚黄舟泊，闲闲短笛音。\n声随夕照断，雨岸荻花深。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37825,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"梦中得句","author":"秦涌","text":"寒梅和月开，烟光正霭霭。\n香气惹人来，罗浮是窗外。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37826,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"晚登忍草庵小阁","author":"秦涌","text":"寻幽来阁中，万象俱寂寂。\n山僧晚未归，涧水时一滴。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37827,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"菊","author":"秦涌","text":"繁英傲清霜，云是花隐者。\n会意即南山，何必东篱下。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37828,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋日渡太湖","author":"秦涌","text":"弥漫极目远，一叶剪洪流。\n浪走山疑簸，潮升岸欲浮。\n三洲天外迥，百族水中秋。\n欸乃渔人曲，苍然起暮愁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37829,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"舟过潘葑","author":"秦涌","text":"顺水扬舲去，篷窗笑语欢。\n山光秋月淡，金柝夜声寒。\n野驿嗔鞍马，驰书响锡銮。\n高桥行在望，星斗五更残。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37830,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"舟行至高山北浜","author":"秦涌","text":"云梯耸却压，截然半溪阴。\n抽桨舣山脚，时闻山鸟鸣。\n幽林有老衲，汲水下烟岑。\n相顾但一笑，悠然野水滨。\n跫然来忽去，松风传磬音。\n拟寻空外迹，云迷石径深。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37831,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"晚登西高山","author":"秦涌","text":"松风谡谡来，一片斜阳冷。\n泠泠石壁泉，宛坐清虚境。\n时闻樵斧声，趵趵黄茅岭。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37832,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"雪夜过梨庄","author":"秦涌","text":"沈庄倾圮变村庄，无复梨枝缀野场。\n雪压篷窗孤客冷，夜深何处吊真香。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37833,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"夏晚野行","author":"秦涌","text":"牛背歌儿度远烟，东风拍拍雨余天。\n溪前忽露晴光晚，唱起垂杨无数蝉。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37834,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"拟游惠山雨阻不果","author":"秦涌","text":"踏石穿林翠接天，拟携双屐度云烟。\n无端十日连绵雨，洗尽游思湖水边。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37835,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"初冬偶成","author":"秦涌","text":"羁窗岁晚意牢骚，闲制新诗饮酒醪。\n恨煞西风无赖甚，漫催黄叶下亭皋。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37836,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"客中感怀四首 其一","author":"秦涌","text":"家山小别未多时，倏忽寒波动水湄。\n客里秋声倍萧飒，无端触起故园思。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37837,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"客中感怀四首 其二","author":"秦涌","text":"闲塘绿水变寒流，少妇砧声不暂收。\n莫道淮南悲落木，秋来我亦最工愁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37838,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"客中感怀四首 其三","author":"秦涌","text":"寒蝉一曲唱新晴，满腹牢骚楚屈平。\n半壁残灯风雨夜，南征又听塞鸿声。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37839,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"客中感怀四首 其四","author":"秦涌","text":"今来事事动人愁，景物萧条宿雨收。\n试看陌头杨柳色，晚烟一抹不胜秋。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37840,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"九日登西高山最高顶","author":"秦涌","text":"茱萸斜插友人同，挥酒仙床兴不穷。\n棋散千村飞鸟外，星罗万象夕阳中。\n闲寻古寺霜前菊，戏说山斋秋末菘。\n百岁英雄今在否，离离衰草霸图空。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37841,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题王石谷秋山行旅图","author":"秦涌","text":"奚奴匹马好追游，宛转山凹涧水流。\n野店酒阑斜照晚，板桥人去暮云秋。\n深林叶落露烟寺，远岫岚生入画楼。\n满眼松涛疑滴翠，寒窗无事当寻幽。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37842,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题西高山岩栖楼","author":"秦涌","text":"秋老山峦携屐行，窑潭旧迹动幽情。\n花开曲径烟深护，人过疏林鸟不惊。\n涧底数声钟欲晚，峰前一缕月初生。\n尘缘到此浑如洗，放眼危楼万象清。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37843,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"晚过芙蓉湖","author":"秦涌","text":"爱学坡翁赤壁游，东桥晚景正清幽。\n千村树色烟中暝，万丈圩堤水外浮。\n旅雁怯霜盘荻渚，寒灯傍岸识渔舟。\n文襄筹画真无匹，汩汩龙泽泻暮流。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37844,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"游惠山从石门上恰望太湖","author":"秦涌","text":"天公知我性嗜奇，攒崖刬石排双峰。\n云边五窍尽谽谺，非具羽翼何能通。\n我闻昔年邵宝妙仙诀，曾离蹇嵼入云穴。\n兹来也学出尘游，杖藜徐步登危屺。\n怒石相争罅似门，气詟心惊疑欲裂。\n寻幽不惜神已痯，却怪天末斜阳晚。\n穿松踏岫凸复凹，心地相平奇路稳。\n湖光万顷动地来，鱼龙隐现那能辨。\n寄身埼礒瞰洪涛，须凛冰涧恒自勉。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37845,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"登惠山绝顶","author":"秦燮","text":"纵目疑无地，抬头只有天。\n一身云雾拥，暝色上峰巅。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37846,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"登君山望江楼","author":"秦燮","text":"试上高楼望，滔滔势不穷。\n浪翻山脚动，潮落海门空。\n舟楫行天外，风云入座中。\n拟寻公子墓，举目但蒿蓬。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37847,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"蓉湖消夏竹枝词十首 其一","author":"秦燮","text":"冰纹窗子绿栏杆，水涨城河荡桨宽。\n怪底少年争下网，对门红袖隔帘看。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37848,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"蓉湖消夏竹枝词十首 其二","author":"秦燮","text":"鬓花双亸翠云钗，女伴相携戏水涯。\n只有小姑羞涩甚，低头无语看弓鞋。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37849,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"蓉湖消夏竹枝词十首 其三","author":"秦燮","text":"垂垂短发女沙弥，水作丰神玉作肌。\n瞥见画船将傍岸，镜台先去理双眉。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37850,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"蓉湖消夏竹枝词十首 其四","author":"秦燮","text":"双双竞趁木兰桡，挟妓招凉五洞桥。\n莺啭一声花底歇，琵琶斜抱隔船招。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37851,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"蓉湖消夏竹枝词十首 其五","author":"秦燮","text":"樽前度曲敛双蛾，酒入香腮媚语多。\n郎酌半杯侬半盏，十分沉醉不胜歌。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37852,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"蓉湖消夏竹枝词十首 其六","author":"秦燮","text":"轻纨歌扇写蝇头，手弄香囊茉莉球。\n水榭半开帘半卷，绿杨阴下看归舟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37853,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"蓉湖消夏竹枝词十首 其七","author":"秦燮","text":"捻脂弄粉踏摇娘，纤手殷勤递酒浆。\n落空暗将瓜子剥，送来还带口脂香。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37854,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"蓉湖消夏竹枝词十首 其八","author":"秦燮","text":"环翠楼边拟扣船，无腔小曲唱当筵。\n酒拼卜夜迟归棹，还向渔舟买钓鲜。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37855,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"蓉湖消夏竹枝词十首 其九","author":"秦燮","text":"新样衣衫时样鬟，慈云寺里正清闲。\n荷花未放游人少，悄语渔船到惠山。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37856,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"蓉湖消夏竹枝词十首 其十","author":"秦燮","text":"敦罗衫子软纱裙，一样温存眼色分。\n只恐贪杯郎醉倒，累侬代饮觉微醺。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37857,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"村居漫兴三首 其一","author":"秦燮","text":"兔走乌飞一刹那，六旬岁月等闲过。\n逢人怕听关心话，道我年来白发多。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37858,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"村居漫兴三首 其二","author":"秦燮","text":"悔作京华万里游，故闾无恙寄吟眸。\n弄孙朝夕含饴惯，索我身牙抱不休。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37859,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"村居漫兴三首 其三","author":"秦燮","text":"笔床茶灶自徘徊，百级云梯志已灰。\n泄柳闭门非傲物，恐教俗客足音来。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37860,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"暮春寄畅园作","author":"秦燮","text":"为爱园林迥出尘，回廊曲蹬往来频。\n饯春有约花迎我，与物无猜鸟近人。\n游屐渐稀惩世态，名山静对见天真。\n披襟宛转桥边坐，俯看游鳞戏水滨。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37861,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"登龙山顶望太湖七十二峰歌","author":"秦燮","text":"陟山不陟昆仑巅，胸襟眼界仍拘牵。\n观水不观沧海外，管窥莫测乾坤大。\n生长湖边数十秋，眼前胜境未穷搜。\n春来忽发登临兴，振策龙峰最上头。\n老去犹夸健腰脚，努力抠衣扳峻崿。\n岩岫参差千仞高，石门谽谺五丁凿。\n吟肩高耸立崔嵬，万顷湖光一镜开。\n七十二峰供指顾，帆樯络绎凫飞来。\n怒涛浴日蛟龙舞，雾髻烟鬟忽吞吐。\n我生此境得未曾，不禁惊呼拍双股。\n倏然云气迷长空，雷声隐隐起谾豅。\n生怕狂风故作恶，挟我飞向汪洋中。\n寺中老僧特超俗，有徒侍侧清如鹄。\n殷勤挽我到云房，山花红润藤萝绿。\n僧挥麈尾说行踪，五岳四渎罗心胸。\n自怜衰朽抛游杖，卓锡三年住九龙。\n闻言不觉掀髯笑，选胜探奇皆入妙。\n名缰束缚空守株，悔不相随一凭眺。\n我当更持三月粮，直渡东海窥扶桑。\n蓬壶方杖恣登览，俯视尘世徒茫茫。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37862,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"劝蚕","author":"孔毓玑","text":"同为浙中人，应识浙中事。\n嘉湖有布更缫丝，桑叶油油遍墟里。\n五月新丝蚕事成，办公先自官租始。\n更有余赀日用饶，女嫁男婚取诸此。\n桐江西来习俗移，土瘠民贫人懈驰。\n我是父母斯民责，循行敢惮临郊鄙。\n既怪耕氓只待天，还嗟女手忘生理。\n夏挥团扇冬携炉，辜负天公付十指。\n东隅旧有桑园名，微行芜没空山里。\n我遣平头赴彼都，购得桑秧五千纪。\n分播民间着意栽，森森弱植倾桃李。\n利赖犹需三五年，经营成局今朝起。\n预求并剪萝繁枝，下饼担泥勤省视。\n籧筐曲薄制坚完，早请蚕师蓄蚕子。\n何须作过觅蝇头，急切归家谋娣姒。\n细检当年旧志书，纺绩生涯似祖妣。\n轧轧机声浃比闾，衣丰食足兴百礼。\n我虽旦晚赋归田，神游叹羡常风美。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37863,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"劝农","author":"孔毓玑","text":"四民纷攘攘，农乃国家干。\n祈谷先祈年，岁岁劳宵旰。\n谁司民牧者，敢惮为民先。\n方春时始和，布谷声声唤。\n青旗届东郊，秧马中田遍。\n募夫载酒肉，遥遥向陇畔。\n挥手招之来，官民喜相见。\n沾涂勿尔嫌，安心尝一脔。\n尔民良苦辛，还愁勤惰半。\n越阡复度陌，祗为勤者劝。\n惰夫方偃仰，胡从饮而啖。\n须尔前致词，时哉慎毋玩。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37864,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"初铨常山","author":"孔毓玑","text":"许国身犹健，亲民计尚疏。\n忽膺百里命，还证数行书。\n弦诵从吾好，桑麻奠厥居。\n惊心呼父母，核实定何如。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37865,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"龙山寺","author":"孔毓玑","text":"谢却篮舆跨涧行，芒鞋沾湿似新晴。\n放眸惊见飞龙势，盥手欣闻漱玉声。\n洞壑留云微有迹，石崖抽树半无名。\n扶筇直上烟深处，螺髻重重拥化城。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37866,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"征粮至浮河宿詹氏书斋次壁间韵","author":"孔毓玑","text":"雨过青山翠万重，浮河新水浸芙蓉。\n入门先拭题诗壁，裁句时闻隔院钟。\n只愿康衢酬帝力，敢期褒德启侯封。\n明年幸免催科累，载酒携筐劳尔农。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37867,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"宿绣溪，梦中有作，觉来止记“饲雏双燕去还来”之句，次早至璞石，即景足成","author":"孔毓玑","text":"淹煞春光兴易灰，眼前有景共徘徊。\n榴花浥露当茶灶，蒲叶翻风到酒杯。\n傍母群凫离复合，饲雏双燕去还来。\n祗怜此璞应怀玉，力士何年为一开。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37868,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"山行遇雨","author":"孔毓玑","text":"霏霏烟雾满寒山，霜叶淋漓点鬓斑。\n喜得耕犁经雨润，篮舆宛转白云闲。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37869,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"龙山纪游十首 其一","author":"孔毓玑","text":"回龙潭下溯流泉，万派分飞一线悬。\n漱石穿畦映空碧，寻源应向白云边。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37870,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"龙山纪游十首 其二","author":"孔毓玑","text":"径转蹊回杳无穷，耸身直欲破鸿蒙。\n小桥隔断仙凡界，何必天台擅化工。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37871,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"龙山纪游十首 其三","author":"孔毓玑","text":"双崖连底都成玉，万树凌霄不附泥。\n翘首岩前参大士，宝山灵鹫晚来栖。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37872,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"龙山纪游十首 其四","author":"孔毓玑","text":"石磴凌危常过鹿，溪流成坎细生鱼。\n珍珠帘卷当晴昼，寒雨垂垂下碧虚。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37873,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"龙山纪游十首 其五","author":"孔毓玑","text":"山花开谢阅春冬，馥馥天香分外浓。\n谁向寒宫乞仙种，根株高寄玉芙蓉。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37874,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"龙山纪游十首 其六","author":"孔毓玑","text":"花香散入空山月，龙气蒸成下界云。\n最是烟岚稠叠处，天光一线漏斜曛。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37875,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"龙山纪游十首 其七","author":"孔毓玑","text":"行行耒憩洗心亭，楹外仙人迹已冥。\n啼为尘心洗难尽，特留滴乳注空青。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37876,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"龙山纪游十首 其八","author":"孔毓玑","text":"龙蟾双洞渺难攀，一任闲云独往还。\n松炬斜穿仙鼠穴，玲珑应笑点头顽。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37877,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"龙山纪游十首 其九","author":"孔毓玑","text":"良田平旷荫松筠，谷口云封远俗尘。\n清献先生未知处，桃源无复问津人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37878,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"龙山纪游十首 其十","author":"孔毓玑","text":"岳然高峙窈然幽，谁数潭西一小丘。\n若得柳州新作记，林峦终古擅风流。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37879,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"与诸子登堠山","author":"浦传桂","text":"相携凌绝顶，一览散千愁。\n飞鸟云边没，明湖天际浮。\n山川原不改，戎马几时休。\n空抱诛茅愿，斜阳归路幽。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37880,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"夏日二首 其一","author":"程素绚","text":"入夏兴偏幽，凭栏豁远眸。\n日长帘半卷，闲煞小银钩。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":37881,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}}]